es pair up and a resumed prompt or a rolled-back draft is exact on every\nrank. The ranks take hip.Startup's steps over the link: rank 0's window, then each rank's admission, load and\nRCCL's init, the least streams and prompt cache before the pool is sized, and a last step before rank 0 serves; a\nrank's refusal is every rank's, named with its reason. The MTP head's pool slot holds every kv head on the drafting\nrank, which the plan counts. The test binary joins a group (hip.joinRun) for teacher, window, replay and a per-block\nresidual trace.","timestamp":"2026-10-20T00:00:30Z","author":{"name":"BlivionIaG","email":"15323295+BlivionIaG@users.noreply.github.com"},"committer":{"name":"BlivionIaG","email":"15323295+BlivionIaG@users.noreply.github.com"}},"repository":{"id":1274723381,"node_id":"R_kgDOS_q8NQ","name":"TensorFold","full_name":"ashhart/TensorFold","private":false,"owner":{"login":"ashhart","id":71890694,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxODkwNjk0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71890694?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashhart","html_url":"https://github.com/ashhart","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashhart/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashhart/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashhart/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashhart/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashhart/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashhart/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashhart/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashhart/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashhart/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"html_url":"https://github.com/ashhart/TensorFold","description":"LLM Inference Engine for Metal and CUDA.","fork":false,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ashhart/TensorFold","forks